Electoral college provide different types of way to learn because your own person. Taking down electoral college will only do us harm. By taking this down you are disgarding the fact of presidential election. Basically, destroying a dream of one of many people ever becoming president. "The Electoral College process consists of the selection of the electors", "the meeting of the electors where they vote for President and Vice President", "the counting of the electoral votes by congress". These reasons are why electoral college should stay. Therefore, Electoral College has a big impact on presidential voting and elections. Counting of the electoral votes is important because the total amount of vote on both electors can be shockingly close. Counting the votes will prove the win of the next president. Another reason as to why Electoral college should stay is "The Electoral College consists of 538 electors". Considering that they're so many , this shouldn't go down without a fight. Another reason why the college should stay is the "Electoral College requies a presidential candidate to have trans-region appeal. No region has enough electoral votes to elect a president." For example, Romney was in the south, has no incentive to campaign heavily in those states, for he gains no electoral votes by increasing his plurality in states that he knows he will win.
